  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The All Progressives Congress (APC) has intensified its national mobilization efforts as the country approaches the 2027 election cycle. Recent activities include a high-profile campaign rally in Ibadan, Oyo State, attended by President Bola Tinubu and First Lady Remi Tinubu. During the event at Mapo Hall, the President officially endorsed several APC governorship aspirants, specifically Alli, Yayi, and Hamzat. Beyond the endorsements, Tinubu made public remarks targeting opposing political groups. Meanwhile, various support groups across Kaduna, Yobe, and Kogi states have declared targets for securing electoral votes for the President. While party leaders focus on consolidating regional backing in the South-West, some political commentators have raised questions regarding the President's electoral outlook, and various interest groups continue to petition the administration regarding policy fulfillment and support.",
